BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:aegina-paliachora-choros-tis-lambris-easter-monday-dance-paliachora-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270503
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270504
SUMMARY:Choros tis Lambris (Easter Monday dance)\, Paliachora
LOCATION:Paliachora\, Aegina\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:On Easter Monday at 11 am the Cultural Society 'O Kapodistrias' revives the old Aeginetan Easter dance at the Stavros\, the open ground among the Byzantine chapels of the abandoned hill-town of Paliachora: live music\, the old songs and a circle dance that everyone is pulled into. Wear walking shoes for the stony path and go on to the monastery of Agios Nektarios just below.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/aegina/#paliachora-choros-tis-lambris-easter-monday-dance-paliachora
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/aegina/#paliachora-choros-tis-lambris-easter-monday-dance-paliachora
END:VEVENT
