DESCRIPTION:Aegina's hospital is dedicated to Agios Dionysios of Zakynthos\, who was bishop of Aegina and lived on the island\, and the translation of his relics is kept on 23-24 August with an episcopal vespers at 7.30 pm and liturgy and memorial next morning. A town event for those already on the island in late August.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/aegina/#aegina-town-feast-of-agios-dionysios-relics-aegina-hospital
